!HEADER: Input file for IECWind version 5.01.01, applied to the QED PHX20 wind turbine with 12.1m dia rotor on 30.5m tower with 31m HH
!Output file parameters
True       SI UNITS (True=SI or False=ENGLISH)
10.        Time for start of IEC transient condition, sec
!Wind Site parameters
2          IEC WIND TURBINE CLASS (1, 2 or 3)
A          WIND TURBULENCE CATEGORY (A, B or C)
8          Slope of the wind inflow (IEC specifies between -8 and +8), deg
3          IEC standard used for wind shear exponent
!Turbine parameters
31.0       Wind turbine hub-height, m or ft
12.3       Wind turbine rotor diameter, m or ft
3.0        Cut-in wind speed, m/s or ft/s
8.7        Rated wind speed, m/s or ft/s
20.0       Cut-out wind speed, m/s or ft/s
!List of Conditions to generate (one per line)
ECD+r
ECD-r
EOGi
EOGo
EDC+i
EDC+o
EDC-i
EDC-o
NWP20.0
EWM50
EWM01



